{"id": "DfWOmzwIue9", "title": "Video by vigyan_bhairav__", "description": "Method 6: The Lightning ⚡🪷🕉️\n\nIn the Vigyan Bhairav Tantra, Bhairav reveals 112 ways to know yourself. This is the sixth.\n\nIn Method 5, the power rose as a ray of light. Now, Bhairav shows that same power rising as lightning (vidyut): flashing, and alive.\n\n🔴 It starts at the root of the spine: muladhara.\n⚡ It travels up the central path: sushumna.\n🪷 Chakra by chakra, it pierces all six: root, belly, navel, heart, throat, brow.\n👑 Until it reaches the opening at the crown: brahmarandhra.\n\n⚠️ You do not push it. You only contemplate it. See it rising, again and again.\n\nAnd the power does not stop there. It rises beyond, past dvadashanta, to Maha Bhairav, supreme awareness.\n\nThis is the great rising: mahodaya. And his true form shines. ✨\n\nOne flash of lightning, and the whole night is lit.\n\n🧘 Try it: sit quietly with your eyes closed. Picture a flash of lightning at the base of your spine, then see it climb from one chakra to the next, up to the crown. Don't force anything; just watch it in your mind. Comment ⚡ if you felt it.\n\n📖 Vigyan Bhairav Tantra, Dharana 6 (verse 29)\n⬅️ New here? Start with Method 1 on my page.\nFollow for one method at a time 🪷\n\n#VigyanBhairavTantra #VigyanBhairav #Bhairava #MahaBhairava #Shiva #Shakti #Tantra #KashmirShaivism #Sushumna #Muladhara #Brahmarandhra #Chakras #SevenChakras #InnerLight #Contemplation #Meditation #Mindfulness #SpiritualAwakening #Consciousness #Yoga #Mahadev #HarHarMahadev #PaperArt #CutPaper #MeditationReels #SpiritualReels #ReelsIndia", "channel": "vigyan_bhairav__", "uploader_id": "70392958166", "uploader": "Bhairav", "timestamp": 1793854808, "like_count": 732, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": 